    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάλεξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>discourse, argument,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				317
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i><i>ad Them.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				255b
			</span></i> (pl.), f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				350d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.40
			</span></i>; <i>conversation, interview,</i> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				155.17
			</span></i>
